		<li><strong>Declared Transit Insurance:</strong> In case you prefer a more cost-effective option, packers and movers may offer declared transit insurance. This policy covers only the declared value of your goods, which means you must determine the valuation of your belongings beforehand.</li>
		<li><strong>IRDAI Marine Transit Insurance:</strong> As packers and movers are responsible for handling your valuable possessions, it is crucial to ensure they offer IRDAI marine transit insurance. This policy provides coverage for accidental collisions or unforeseen delays during transportation.</li>
